  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this line, UNDP Cameroon has developed the Cameroon National Window to provide stabilisation support in targeted localities of the Far North Regions of the Country, focusing on two major objectives: 1.	Immediate stabilisation of specific areas, cleared of Boko Haram control, but where communities remain vulnerable to continued infiltration and attack.2.	Initiate community driven activities along the corridor in coordination with the security forces and local authorities to maintain the return</narrative>
